{"id":"n49261-2-7","stage":5,"title":"큰절 · 磕头","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n49261-2-7-1","ko":"형, 설날에는 어른들께 세배를 해야 하지? 어떻게 하는 거야?","zh":"哥，过年要向长辈拜年行礼吧，怎么做？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형,","meaning":"哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"2","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}},{"text":"설날에는","meaning":"春节","explanation":"설날：春节；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"설날","audio":"/audio/bcf982ecaec0843c761c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69055","senseId":"1","lemma":"설날","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설날에는","audio":"/audio/e9c933aa34aa846e8f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"어른들께","meaning":"长辈，长者","explanation":"어른：长辈，长者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；께：에게 的敬语形式，表示“给、向、对”某位受尊敬的人。","readings":[{"term":"어른","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72574","senseId":"4","lemma":"어른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어른들께","audio":"/audio/c1325741ed8c3136901f.mp3"}},{"text":"세배를","meaning":"拜年","explanation":"세배：拜年；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"세배","audio":"/audio/a21e3dc2524c9a2fa52e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70184","senseId":"1","lemma":"세배","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"세배를","audio":"/audio/cf2d8a747d5e83025726.mp3"}},{"text":"해야","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해야","audio":"/audio/c8f942c39d369acda96c.mp3"}},{"text":"하지?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하지","audio":"/audio/e16a62e07a7c6fa42e9f.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거야","audio":"/audio/16592c1618a6826ee403.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"997d7178d3aa00dd","term":"형","zh":"哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3","entryId":"20286","definition":"男子用于亲切地指称或称呼比自己年长的男性。","pronunciation":["형"]},{"id":"bcf982ecaec0843c","term":"설날","zh":"春节","audio":"/audio/bcf982ecaec0843c761c.mp3","entryId":"69055","definition":"韩国节日之一。日期为阴历1月1日，这天早晨家人、亲戚聚在一起举行祭祀，给长辈拜年。还吃年糕汤、玩掷柶游戏、跳跳板、放风筝等民俗游戏。","pronunciation":["설ː랄"]},{"id":"00bcc9cf30903659","term":"어른","zh":"长辈，长者","audio":"/audio/00bcc9cf309036598111.mp3","entryId":"72574","definition":"在家庭或集团等里，由于年龄大、经验丰富而受到人们尊敬的人。","pronunciation":["어ː른"]},{"id":"a21e3dc2524c9a2f","term":"세배","zh":"拜年","audio":"/audio/a21e3dc2524c9a2fa52e.mp3","entryId":"70184","definition":"春节向长辈行的跪拜礼。","pronunciation":["세ː배"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/4b757f5f29e710f42840.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n49261-2-7-2","ko":"형이 큰절을 하는 방법을 가르쳐 줄게.","zh":"哥哥教你行大礼的方法。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"형이","meaning":"哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）","explanation":"형：哥哥（男性对年长男性的亲切称呼）；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"형","audio":"/audio/997d7178d3aa00dd51c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20286","senseId":"2","lemma":"형","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"형이","audio":"/audio/7eb107b79d357f4a6f75.mp3"}},{"text":"큰절을","meaning":"磕头，屈膝躬身大礼","explanation":"큰절：磕头，屈膝躬身大礼；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"큰절","audio":"/audio/6108d42cb491aedb0205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49261","senseId":"2","lemma":"큰절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"큰절을","audio":"/audio/b018687bb6a376e09470.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"방법을","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방법을","audio":"/audio/09b88dfe3ffc36f7f385.mp3"}},{"text":"가르쳐","meaning":"教，教授，传授","explanation":"가르